# Keeps the db/ directory in version control.
#
# The database is NOT here and is not created here at runtime. It is created at
# `legal_agent.config.DB_PATH`, which resolves under LEGAL_AGENT_HOME (the
# platform per-user data dir by default) — see AGENTS.md trap 1. The dense
# index is written beside that database, not here either.
#
# This file used to say the SQLite file is created here at runtime. It is not,
# and stale files matching that description sat in this directory long enough
# for two agents to compute published figures against them. They now live in
# _orphan_do_not_use/ with a note; no code path reaches them.
#
# To find out which corpus a process is actually reading:
#     python -c "import legal_agent; print(legal_agent.corpus_fingerprint().render())"
